    'arch.how1': 'Load a system — bodies come from the project catalogue, or from EDSM when missing.',
    'arch.how2': 'Press “+ structure” on a body: the list immediately shows what cannot be built there and why.',
    'arch.how3': 'Surface and orbital structures sit in separate sections of the body card, and used slots show on the bar.',
    'arch.how4': 'Any structure in the plan can be edited: type, body, status, note and primary-port role.',
