    'ppAdmin.notModified': 'The EDSM dump matches the previous load — the site data is up to date. “Force re-download” will fetch it again.',
    'ppAdmin.noLoadsYet': 'No loads since the site was updated. Press “Load data” — progress will show up here.',
    'ppAdmin.loadingState': 'Loading state…',
    'ppAdmin.interrupted': 'The previous load was cut off with the site process (update or restart). What was downloaded and split remains on the server — “Load now” continues from the same place (written shards are not written again); the powerplay-sync job and opening the PowerPlay tab do this by themselves.',
    'ppAdmin.logTitle': 'Process log',
    'ppAdmin.logCopied': 'Copied',
    'ppAdmin.logCopy': 'Copy',
    'ppAdmin.logEmpty': 'The log is empty — it appears with the first load.',
    'ppAdmin.logMigrationNote': 'The log is kept in the database after the migration 20261018180000_powerplay_sync_progress.sql; without it, it lasts until the site restarts.',
    'ppAdmin.src1': '— the nightly EDSM dump (≈3–4 MB gzip): all systems whose PowerPlay state pilots reported over the last ~30 days.',
    'ppAdmin.src2': 'Only controlled systems reach the site (strongholds, fortified, exploited); Unoccupied is dropped.',
    'ppAdmin.src3': 'The archive is downloaded to the server in full over {connections} connections (POWERPLAY_DOWNLOAD_SEGMENTS), in file pieces of {size}; a drop or site restart does not lose what was downloaded. A connection silent for {stall} s (POWERPLAY_STALL_SECONDS) reconnects at once instead of waiting the 70 s OS timeout.',
    'ppAdmin.srcShortOff': 'Short requests are disabled (POWERPLAY_REQUEST_KB=off).',
    'ppAdmin.srcShortOn': 'Requests are {size} each, every one on a new connection (POWERPLAY_REQUEST_KB).',
    'ppAdmin.srcShortAuto': 'If connections stall after only a few kilobytes (the server network cutting sessions to foreign CDNs, and EDSM sits behind Cloudflare), the download switches by itself to short requests below that threshold, each on a new connection.',
    'ppAdmin.srcSplit': 'Once the archive is on the server, records of one system are gathered together (EDSM writes one record per power in a system) and systems are laid out in shards of {shards}, then the shards are written to the database; a shard is the unit of resumption. If EDSM rebuilds the dump mid-download, the download restarts with the fresh dump. After a successful load the archive and shards',
    'ppAdmin.srcKeep': 'stay on the server (POWERPLAY_ARCHIVE_KEEP=1).',
    'ppAdmin.srcDelete': 'are deleted from the server.',
    'ppAdmin.srcAuto': 'Automatically: the powerplay-sync scheduler job every 12 hours, and also when the PowerPlay tab is opened if there is no data or it is older than {stale} h (after a failure, at most once per {retry} min).',
    'ppAdmin.srcAutoNext': 'The next run is {time} if the job is enabled in JOBS_ENABLED.',
    'ppAdmin.srcAutoRetry': 'The next attempt is no earlier than {time}.',
    'ppAdmin.srcAutoTail': 'A dump identical to the previous one is not downloaded again.',
    'ppAdmin.srcGuard': 'Data protection: a broken gzip, an HTTP error, fewer than {min} systems or a dump less than half the previous one leave the table alone — the map keeps yesterday\'s data. “Force re-download” loads the same dump again and skips the shrunk-dump check.',
    'ppAdmin.eddnTitle': 'Live EDDN data — system owners from pilot journals',
    'ppAdmin.eddnLead': 'The EDSM dump does not say which power owns a contested system. The game journal knows it (the ControllingPower field), and thousands of pilots send it to EDDN — EDSM, Spansh and Inara get their data from there too. The listener takes jumps and game logins from the stream and updates PowerPlay (owner, state) and factions with the same parsing as the Colonial Helper journals.',
    'ppAdmin.eddnTraffic': 'Traffic is about 2–5 GB per day (the relay does not filter by data type). The server is in Russia: long connections to foreign hosts may be “frozen” by the TSPU — the listener then reconnects by itself, and the log below shows how much data gets through before the freeze.',
    'ppAdmin.eddnStop': 'Turn EDDN off',
    'ppAdmin.eddnStart': 'Turn EDDN on',
